      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787023266020,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two CGI dispatches re-derive a shell the browser already had, and a catalog it already held.\nThe router deletes exactly that. The view's data calls survive untouched — they simply start 225 ms earlier.",
