      "updated": 1787023266021,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "fork CGI + ucode VM x2 ................. 4 ms\n\nimport luci.dispatcher x2 .............. 74 ms\n\nmenu tree stat + parse x2 .............. 24 ms\n\nubus session probe x2 .................. 8 ms\n\nrender view.ut + header.ut\n  1 ubus · 2 uci · 1 lsdir\n  2 readfile .......................... 18.1 KB\n\ni18n catalog, uncacheable .............. 224 KB",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "fork CGI + ucode VM x2 ................. 4 ms\n\nimport luci.dispatcher x2 .............. 74 ms\n\nmenu tree stat + parse x2 .............. 24 ms\n\nubus session probe x2 .................. 8 ms\n\nrender view.ut + header.ut\n  1 ubus · 2 uci · 1 lsdir\n  2 readfile .......................... 18.1 KB\n\ni18n catalog, uncacheable .............. 224 KB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
