      "text": "the view's own ubus data calls\n  same work, same cost ................ unchanged\n\n/admin/menu\n  once per SESSION, not per navigation  68.2 ms\n\nstatic CSS/JS\n  already cached; cheap to serve ....... 0.8 ms\n\nuci cache refill\n  one extra batched ubus call .......... kept",
