      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787023266023,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "route resolution — dispatcher.uc's own\n  alias / firstchild / node_weight / wildcard rules\n\nACL fold down the dispatch path\n  -> nodespec.readonly -> Save & Apply state\n\nL.env, body[data-page], document.title\npage-scoped patch CSS/JS and node css state\n\nmenu highlight, breadcrumb, #tabmenu\n  state only — menus are not rebuilt\n\nTEARDOWN\n  Poll queue · uci cache · intervals\n  per-render listeners · modals ........ +1 ubus call",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "route resolution — dispatcher.uc's own\n  alias / firstchild / node_weight / wildcard rules\n\nACL fold down the dispatch path\n  -> nodespec.readonly -> Save & Apply state\n\nL.env, body[data-page], document.title\npage-scoped patch CSS/JS and node css state\n\nmenu highlight, breadcrumb, #tabmenu\n  state only — menus are not rebuilt\n\nTEARDOWN\n  Poll queue · uci cache · intervals\n  per-render listeners · modals ........ +1 ubus call",
      "autoResize": true,
